message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "@three-ws/portal"
abstract: "Turn any website into a walkable 3D world. Reads a page's real structure and lays out a city from it: sections become buildings, links become doors, images become billboards. Pure layout in JS, a client for the three.ws Portal API, a CLI, and an MCP server."
type: software
authors:
  - name: three.ws contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/nirholas/portal"
url: "https://nirholas.github.io/portal/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
